            "type": "text/html"
          }
        ]
      },
      "note": [
        "This table contains statistics on water abstraction in industry disaggregated by NACE section and type of water. Industry is defined as companies within section B, C and D (Mining and quarrying, Manufacturing and Electricity, gas, steam and air conditioning supply) in the NACE framework. Type of water denotes source of water, e.g. groundwater, surface water, sea water or water purchased from other water supplier. Note that water abstraction from nuclear power plants is not included in the table. Volumes of abstracted water can differ from volumes of used water. For data on water use, please use the table: Water use in industry by region and type of water.\r\nThe statistics refer to water abstraction during the entire year of reference."
      ],
